<title>HONG KONG: Jardine Fleming HK says H1 profits unaffected.</title>
<headline>Jardine Fleming HK says H1 profits unaffected.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jardine Fleming said on Thursday first half profits for 1996 were not currently expected to be &quot;materially different&quot; from profits in the first half of 1995.</p>
</text>
